  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through entrepreneuship training courses, the project seeks to give women and youth the tools and know-how to start their own businesses. Overall, the aim is to enable the target groups to secure livelihoods, income and a stable life siituation, and to promote economic growth in the Iraqi society as a whole.
